                                        "entry_id": "a48718dc-8ead-378b-8ac7-09bb0497afd3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To manage (a wooded area) sustainably, as a coppice, by periodically cutting back woody plants to promote new growth."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81f4ebc9-585d-48a2-b9b9-dfdee0c72363",
                                                "sense_id": "85377782-348a-36be-b402-0b293b6da020",
                                                "text": "Her plan to coppice the woods should keep her self-sufficient in fuel indefinitely."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdf376e4-39ff-39e8-b790-4d8bbf466928",
